66","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/josuechavando350-png/nexus-engine/actions/runs/36820687233/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/josuechavando350-png/nexus-engine/actions/runs/36820687233/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/josuechavando350-png/nexus-engine/actions/runs/36820687233/rerun","previous_attempt_url":null,"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/josuechavando350-png/nexus-engine/actions/workflows/369620615","head_commit":{"id":"a33a012591cd6625ddb921d995bb1bd95b4a5406","tree_id":"eda36fdc07e82ccdcc9666799fa8fe21aacc7f1d","message":"RMC-006: declared or dispatched anchor; dispatch-only acquisition\n\nAn incremental refresh (RMC-010) needs RMC-006 at a later anchor A1. The\nanchor was fixed in code.\n\n- `anchor_from_flags`: the declared anchor unless both `--anchor-number`\n  and `--anchor-hash` name another block. Giving one of them is refused.\n  `run_current_surface`, `HistoryPlan::mainnet_at`, `run_history` and the\n  resume check take the anchor; the declared one stays the default.\n- The history step now refuses a current-surface report observed at another\n  anchor than its plan.\n- Workflow:\n  - `workflow_dispatch` inputs `anchor_number` / `anchor_hash`.\n  - At the declared anchor the measured 67 reserves are still required. At\n    any other anchor, the reserve count read from the three-provider current\n    surface must be reproduced by the history and the closeout.\n  - The evidence artifact is named by anchor, exact head, run and attempt.\n  - Live acquisition runs only from `workflow_dispatch`, in\n    nqc-census-public-rpc. A `pull_request` run executes every gate except\n    the acquisition, in a per-ref group, and cannot displace a pending\n    acquisition.\n  - The job timeout rises from 90 to 240 minutes. The offline crash/resume\n    matrix is sequential per case, and run 36619916268 spent over 50\n    minutes in it.\n- The five crash/resume cases share nothing (own store, own transport) and\n  now run concurrently. Every case is checked exactly as before and reported\n  in cut order.\n\nTests: the history suite has 11 tests (+1: a current surface from another\nanchor is refused), plus a unit test for the anchor flags. The synthetic\ncurrent reports now carry their anchor as live reports do. The workspace\npasses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NLdQDejpkSd91EAJkqfDF8","timestamp":"2026-09-29T20:36:02Z","author":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com"},"committer":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com"}},"repository":{"id":1333360261,"node_id":"R_kgDOT3l2hQ","name":"nexus-engine","full_name":"josuechavando350-png/nexus-engine","private":false,"owner":{"login":"josuechavando350-png","id":317648718,"node_id":"U_kgDOEu7vTg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317648718?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/josuechavando350-png","html_url":"https://github.com/josuechavando350-png","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josuechavando350-png/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josuechavando350-png/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josuechavando350-png/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josuechavando350-png/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josuechavando350-png/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josuechavando350-png/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josuechavando350-png/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josuechavando350-png/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/josuechavando350-png/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/josuechavando350-png/nexus-engine","description":"NEXUS — consolidated V1→V6 industrial intelligence platform","fork":fal